<section class="section">
  <div class="container who-grid">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Gigawatt Energy was established in 2020 as a family-run business in Merrifield, Mickleham. We design, supply and install CEC-approved solar PV, battery storage and backup power systems for homes and businesses across Melbourne's north and west — 1,600+ of them so far.</p>
      <p>The business is led by a licensed <strong>'A' Grade Electrician</strong> and <strong>SAA Accredited Solar &amp; Battery Installer</strong>, with an in-house team of electricians and apprentices. That matters: the people who quote your job are the people who install it — no sales middlemen, no subcontractor roulette.</p>
      <h2>Our mission &amp; vision</h2>
      <p><strong>Mission:</strong> accelerate the shift to greener energy through cost-effective, efficient solar solutions.</p>
      <p><strong>Vision:</strong> empower communities with smart energy — and grow into a leader in renewable energy without ever losing the standards of a family business.</p>
      <h2>What we stand for</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>High-quality workmanship, every install</li>
        <li>Full warranty support on panels, inverters and batteries</li>
        <li>Direct contact with your electrician — clear communication from quote to switch-on</li>
        <li>Responsive after-sales support: we answer the phone after the install too</li>
        <li>Safe, efficient, compliant systems, custom-designed for each customer</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <figure class="who-photo" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
        <img src="{{ images.roof.src }}" alt="{{ images.roof.alt }}" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption>Our team's work on a Melbourne rooftop</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="stats" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)">
        {% for s in site.stats %}
        <div class="stat card"><div class="num">{{ s.value }}</div><div class="lbl">{{ s.label }}</div></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

